{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30585","headline":"和主司王起 · 孟球","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当年门下化龙成，今日余波进後生。\n仙籍共知推丽藻，禁垣同得荐嘉名。\n桃蹊早茂夸新萼，菊圃初开耀晚英。\n谁料羽毛方出谷，许敎齐和九臯鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟球","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}